tacks the russian soldier and  as he begins to fight back  her dear too starts attacking him with  another makeshift weapon  they managed to bring him down  after saying goodbye to their dying  father the two of them sneak out of  their home in search of a vehicle they  can escape him  unfortunately upon entering a truck they  are then immediately captured by roman  barkov the russian general responsible  for invading their homeland  they would be held captive for the next  10 years  as prisoners of war farah and hadir were  barely fed or given water and were  consistently tortured for information on  the identity of someone called commander  kareem  while imprisoned she was given a key by  hadir and at that same moment barkov  arrived  he ordered his men to take a deer to a  warehouse  while he dealt with farah  while interrogating her some more he is  interrupted by an explosion from outside  the compound  before he leaves to investigate barkov  orders his men to take all the prisoners  to the warehouse and kill them  farrah then escapes herself after  killing a few guards she makes it to the  main cell block and is greeted by her  sisters who show her what the key is for  a weapon cabinet  they grabbed some weapons and proceeded  to fight their way out of the prison  complex towards the warehouse where  hadir was taken  but it was there that they were ambushed  by the russian forces  however it was at that very moment when  an sas squad arrived led by a young john  price  before the siblings were evacuated from  the prison farrah introduces herself to  price as commander kareem  the leader of the urzakhstan liberation  front  alex tells farah and her brother hadir  about the stolen gas  they agree to help as long as he will  assist them in the ualif's fight against  the russian forces led by general roman  bakov  alex and farrar go into a nearby city  under disguise  they eventually come across a couple of  helicopters and alex detonates them with  explosives  he brings the russian forces down upon  their position while ferrara keeps them  busy hadir and alex use explosive remote  control planes armed with c4 to take out  several russian vehicles  the ulf forces launch their attack and  are able to capture the armories in the  compound  the russians launch a counter-attack  with heavily armed vehicles  but after a quick call from alex to his  cia contact these were quickly dealt to  by u.s apache attack helicopters  back in england price and garrick leave  an attack on an alcatala safe house  after eliminating the terrorists inside  they find a laptop that provides intel  on the whereabouts of the alcatala  leader known as the wolf  he is hiding out in the hospital in  uzdan  next alex together with a large marine  squad launches an attack on the alcatala  occupied hospital where they would  eventually capture the wolf  they take him to the american embassy  where he would be handed over to price  but the alcatala led by a man called the  butcher arrive demanding the wolf's  release  while all of this is happening the wolf  says that it wasn't them that took the  russian gas though he wishes it was  the butcher attacked the embassy killing  several civilians but price and garrick  have now arrived and managed to help  alex and the wolf escape  their team make their way to a nearby  facility where they take up defensive  positions  they fight their way through to the  ambassador's residence but while they're  fending off the attacks alcatel forces  managed to breach a wall getting away  with their leader  alex farrar and hadir leave the city and  set up a position outside the only  highway out of the city in an attempt to  ambush them  they are able to defeat the enemy but  the wolf hasn't arrived yet  however while waiting they are met by  barkhov's forces  heavily outnumbered hadir grabs alex and  tells him of the explosives in his truck  that they can use  it is here that alex notices the stolen  russian gas in the back o