ually task force one for one hacks  into zarkaev's comms locating him at a  nuclear silo in bunker ten  in the bunker zarkaev has armed the nuke  and is preparing to launch  but suddenly price appears shooting him  and then throwing him over the ledge  down the silo  then with very little time to spare  price manages to terminate the missile  launch with nikolai's help  leaving the facility task force 141 look  out across the region as the battle  continues to play out  when suddenly price is contacted by soap  requesting backup half a kilometer off  the coast  now you might be wondering why i'm  suddenly covering the lore of a game  that is two three years old  one i wanted to cover this at the time  of release but was busy with other  content and two call of duty modern  warfare 2 is coming out in the near  future and from what we can tell so far  it will be a continuation of the 2019  call of duty modern warfare story where  captain price's task force 141 will be  continuing the fight  i'm not going to cover the potential  story direction this next installment  will take in this video but perhaps this  is something i can look into later for  now just look at this as a recap of the  modern warfare story before the sequel  releases  i hope this summary videos help bring  you up to speed i'll likely be covering  a few other aspects of the modern  warfare story in coming videos so if you  have any questions please let me know  otherwise thank you very much for  watching and i'll catch you in the next  one cheers  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]

